 > Plugins version and implementation are not used as cache keys. We recommend that you delete the cache when updating plugins.
 
+## `--cache-location`
+
+Path to the cache file. Defaults to `./node_modules/.cache/prettier/.prettier-cache`.
+Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory. Requires `--cache`.
+
+Use separate cache files for independent formatting runs that share a `node_modules` directory:
+
+```bash
+prettier --write --cache --cache-location .prettiercache src
+```
+
 ## `--cache-strategy`
 
 Strategy for the cache to use for detecting changed files. Can be either `metadata` or `content`.
